		<name>Birdo VPN</name>
		<summary>Fast, private, quantum-resistant VPN</summary>
		<desc>BirdoVPN is a fast, privacy-first VPN with post-quantum protection built in.

Your tunnel is secured with WireGuard and wrapped in a post-quantum key
exchange (Rosenpass), so traffic captured today cannot be decrypted by a
future quantum computer (&quot;harvest now, decrypt later&quot;). An optional stealth
transport helps the connection blend in on restrictive networks.

Features:

* WireGuard-based tunnel with a post-quantum key exchange layer
* A reactive kill switch that blocks traffic if the tunnel drops
* Split tunnelling — choose which apps use the VPN
* A global network of servers with fast connect and one-tap switching
* No activity logs; accounts can be created without an email address
* DNS handled inside the tunnel to reduce leaks

This build is distributed outside Google Play and is signed with Birdo's own
release key. It is the same APK published on GitHub Releases. A BirdoVPN
account is required to connect to the network.

Note: the app bundles prebuilt native networking components (Xray and
WireGuard-go), which is why it is served from this self-hosted repository
rather than the main f-droid.org catalogue.</desc>
